prompt used {
    write a python programm to estimate pi using the monte carlo methode by drawing N random points inside a square from x [0,1] and y [0,1]. then check if the points are within a test quarter circle or not... the fraction inside the quarter circle should approximate a quarter of pi.
    let this script run for different values of N between 10² and 10^7 and plot the error to N ratio with matplotlib.
    Points on the edge of the quarter circle should be counted as in the circle.
    you can start by placing 4 of the N points at the corners of the coordinate system.
}

Which steps did the agent take without being asked?

-   use numpy
-   plot the task for N=2500
-   plot an estimate of pi versus N
-   plot the convergence of pi versus N
-   name the axis and plots
-   provide a legend for each plot
-   include a theoretical scaling of the error in the plot
-   scale the axis of the plot
-   include commandline arguments
-   check if N is above 4 (4 non random starting points were set in the)
-   set up a rng and seed